# House Cartographer, Survival: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if this creature is tapped, reveal cards from the top
# of your library until you reveal a land card. Put that card into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random
# order." Cartographer is cast on turn 1 and attacks on turn 3 (no vigilance, so tapped). The library is Grizzly Bears, Llanowar Elves, Forest, then
# twelve Islands after the turn 3 draw (Lightning Bolt): the two creature cards are revealed before the Forest, the Forest (and not
# the Island under it) goes to hand, and the Bears and Elves go to the bottom (14 left; their order is random, so only that
# they are in the library, below the Islands, is checked). Hand: 7 - 3 cast + Bolt + Forest = 6 (CR 701.20, 401.4, 603.4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
House Cartographer
Island x4
Lightning Bolt
Grizzly Bears
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.House Cartographer.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.House Cartographer.Tapped = false
Bot1.Attack(House Cartographer > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.House Cartographer.Tapped = true
[T3 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Colors.Count = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 14
Bot1.Library.Top = Island
Bot1.Library.Grizzly Bears.Power = 2
Bot1.Library.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 18
